<section class="page-intro price-intro"><div class="site-container"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--clay)">Market intelligence</span><h1>Use recorded local ranges as trade context.</h1><p>These entries are recorded by authorized platform administrators from named local sources. They are reference information—not a guaranteed trade price, an offer, or financial advice.</p></div></section>
